---
// 01 — The Real Problem
---
<section class="problem section" id="problem">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="frame-mark"></span> <span class="num">01</span> &nbsp;The Real Problem</p>

    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="problem-head reveal">
        <h2 class="display">
          Before Anyone Will Buy Your <em>Product</em><br />
          They Must First Buy Into Your <em>Story</em>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p class="problem-body reveal">
        When ads aren't converting, social is flat, and investors aren't hopping on board —
        the real problem is that they can't see the value. The brand story isn't landing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem { background: var(--bg-deep); }
  .problem .container { text-align: center; }
  .problem-grid {
    margin-top: 54px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 34px;
  }
  .problem-head h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3.9vw, 54px); line-height: 1.12; text-wrap: initial; }
  .problem-body {
    font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.3vw, 17px); line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .problem .eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
</style>
